            Column { width: 100% padding: 18.0
                Text {
                    content: "A GPU interface still needs browser-grade prose. This intentionally long paragraph wraps naturally, remains selectable, and is clamped after exactly two visual lines without a separate clipping widget or a pre-truncated string."
